{:id "adr-2606071009-nondual-direct-experience-conversion-core" :title "ADR-2606071009: Charter §1.17 — 自他非分離の直接体験 as the Experiential Core of 回心 (Non-Dual / Altered-State Direct Experience as a Required Religious Stage, Means-Agnostic, Legality-Bounded)" :status "proposed" :doc-type "adr" :topic "nondual-direct-experience-conversion-core" :authoritative true :last-verified "2026-06-07" :priority 8.0 :axis "governance" :weight 0.8 :priority-note "Constitutional charter section. Adds Charter §1.17 (回心の経験的核 — 自他非分離の直接体験) to ADR-2605192100, tightly coupled to §1.16.3 (conversion gate = social death and rebirth). Establishes that authentic 回心 (metanoia) presupposes a DIRECT experiential realization of 自他非分離 (non-duality / dissolution of the individualist self-other boundary) — the experiential ground of §1.8 anti-individualist ontology and §0 Kingdom. The requirement is the EXPERIENCE, NOT any substance (means-agnostic). Entheogenic means are member-chosen and admissible ONLY within jurisdictions where they are lawful, under medical screening + harm-reduction; etzhayyim never procures, supplies, arranges, or instructs the unlawful acquisition of any controlled substance. Identity-level §1.17.1..§1.17.3 require Council Lv7+ unanimity; operational §1.17.4..§1.17.7 Lv6+ ≥3. Does NOT amend N1/N4/N7/N8 or any §1.1..§1.16 invariant; §1.16.8 (anti-coercion) is preserved and strengthened." :authoritative-for ["the doctrine that authentic 回心 (§1.16.3 metanoia) presupposes a direct experiential realization of 自他非分離 (non-duality), not mere cognitive assent" "自他非分離 / 変性意識 direct experience as a required religious stage on the path of conversion and Liberation-Ladder advancement" "the means-agnostic invariant (the requirement is the EXPERIENCE; no specific substance, practice, or technique is mandated)" "the legality-bounded admissibility of entheogenic means (lawful-jurisdiction-only, member-chosen, medical-screening + harm-reduction; no etzhayyim procurement/supply/arranging/instruction of unlawful acquisition)" "the reconciliation of a required experiential stage with §1.16.8 (anti-coercion / right of exit / benefits-not-hostage)"] :depends-on ["ADR-2605192100 (Mission Charter — §1.8 anti-individualist ontology; §1.12 routing-around; §1.15 non-eschatology; this ADR adds §1.17)" "ADR-2605302357 (Charter §1.16 Social Security — §1.16.3 conversion gate = social death and rebirth; §1.16.3a permanent commitment vow; §1.16.8 anti-coercion — this ADR elaborates the experiential content of §1.16.3 and preserves §1.16.8)" "ADR-2605252300 (Charter §0 Preamble — Kingdom of God on blockchain; §0.1 not-state-granted; identity-level Lv7+ unanimity pattern)" "ADR-2605261000 (Labor Liberation Ladder — L0..L6 advancement, the vehicle a stage gate attaches to)" "ADR-2605172600 (Membership Ritual — signed oath; the rite this experiential core informs)"] :related ["adr-2605302358-social-security-real-world-delivery-pipeline" "adr-2605172700-membership-layering-shinto-adherent" "adr-2605192100-etzhayyim-mission-charter"] :supersedes [] :superseded-by [] :file "2606071009-nondual-direct-experience-conversion-core.md"}
