{:id "adr-2606031600-kotoba-os-content-addressed-wasm-unikernel" :title "ADR-2606031600: kotoba-os — a content-addressed, WASM-first Rust unikernel OS for OT / PLC / k8s, agent-centric (Holochain) over the kotoba Datom log (Datomic preserved)" :status "proposed" :doc-type "adr" :topic "storage-substrate" :authoritative true :last-verified "2026-06-03" :priority 5.0 :axis "architecture" :weight 0.66 :priority-note "Extends kotoba (the canonical storage substrate engine, ADR-2605262130) UPWARD into a system-software layer: a single-address-space Rust unikernel (Hermit-derived) whose userland is content-addressed WASM Component Model actors and whose canonical machine state IS the kotoba Datom log (ADR-2605312345, unchanged). One image, three lower edges — bare-metal/microVM unikernel (OT/PLC field device + k8s pod), hosted Linux process (dev/sidecar), and browser wasm32 (ameno). Holochain agent-centric model: each node is an agent, its source chain IS its local Datom-log segment, validated by neighbours. No constitutional invariant is changed; this is a new deployment shape for the existing substrate." :authoritative-for ["kotoba-os — content-addressed WASM-first unikernel runtime shape for kotoba" "WASM Component Model as the kotoba-os userland execution unit (control program / agent / cell)" "OT/PLC scan-cycle-as-Datom-transaction control model (soft-RT R0; hard-RT/SIL gated)" "kotoba-os as a k8s-schedulable microVM/runwasi node class (Murakumo kubelet)" "machine management-plane state modelled as Datoms (Datomic-for-the-OS)"] :depends-on ["adr-2605262130-kotoba-storage-substrate-unification" "adr-2605312345-kotoba-datom-first-class-canonical-state" "adr-2605215000-etzhayyim-inference-murakumo-only-no-runpod" "adr-2605231525-no-server-key-religious-corp-architecture" "adr-2605192200-etzhayyim-ip-free-release-charter-rider" "adr-2605241900-baien-edge-target-invariant"] :related ["adr-2605231400-kotoba-datomic-holochain-iso-substrate" "adr-2605192100-etzhayyim-mission