{:id "adr-2605202000-etzhayyim-amnesty-legal-person-debt-actor" :title "ADR-2605202000: Amnesty — Legal-Person Debt Restructuring Actor (sibling to Yobel)" :status "proposed" :doc-type "adr" :topic "etzhayyim-amnesty-legal-person-debt-actor" :authoritative true :last-verified "2026-05-20" :priority 7.0 :axis "doctrine-runtime" :weight 0.7 :priority-note "yobel.etzhayyim.com (ADR-2605201800) は **自然人** (natural person) のみを scope とする。法人 (sovereign / corporate / partnership / multilateral) の債務リストラ・恩赦は yobel R14 で reject されるが、religious-corp doctrine 上 etzhayyim の関与が正当化される文脈 (Charter §1 mission の institutional dimension) は存在する。本 ADR は yobel の sibling actor として法人債務リストラ専用の amnesty actor を新設計し、yobel との対称 pair (個人 vs 法人) を確立する。" :authoritative-for ["org.etzhayyim.amnesty.* lexicon family (transitional NSID: com.etzhayyim.apps.etzhayyim.amnesty.*)" "sovereign debt restructuring rite catalog (HIPC / Paris Club / Brady Bond / multilateral)" "corporate amnesty rite catalog (Chapter 11 multi-creditor amnesty / scheme of arrangement / 会社更生)" "voluntary multi-creditor / multilateral consent invariant" "3-axis split: vendor reads + etzhayyim writes via Council Lv9 multisig" "cross-actor delegation: amnesty rejects natural-person debtors → defers to yobel"] :depends-on ["adr-2605201800-etzhayyim-yobel-debt-release-actor" "adr-2605192100-etzhayyim-mission-charter" "adr-2605192200-etzhayyim-ip-free-release-charter-rider" "adr-2605192230-etzhayyim-three-tier-enforcement-implementation" "adr-2605172400-etzhayyim-vendor-three-axis-split-rule"] :related ["adr-2605201800-etzhayyim-yobel-debt-release-actor"] :supersedes [] :superseded-by [] :file "2605202000-etzhayyim-amnesty-legal-person-debt-actor.md"}
{:id "adr-2605201900-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-s5-extended-sovereignty" :title "ADR-2605201900: kuni-umi S5 — extended sovereignty deployment (S5a river / S5b ocean / S5c atmosphere / S5d orbit; stewardship-only operation; 4 new robot classes; final roadmap phase)" :status "proposed" :doc-type "adr" :topic "kuni-umi-s5-extended-sovereignty" :authoritative true :last-verified "2026-05-20" :priority 7.0 :axis "implementation" :weight 0.7 :priority-note "kuni-umi roadmap の最終 phase。S1-S4 までは terrestrial 4-layer land sovereignty (LandRegistry) 内。S5 は ADR-2605192330 extended sovereignty (UNCLOS 海洋 / 水利権 河川 / Chicago Convention 大気 / Outer Space Treaty 軌道) を物理 deployment で初めて exercise。Religious-corp が non-state actor として国際法上 stewardship-only claim を physical world で堅持しつつ、国家 utility 独占の 4 domain 全てに parallel-governance presence を確立する。S5a (river, lowest international complexity) → S5b (ocean coastal) → S5c (atmosphere HAPS) → S5d (orbit LEO microsat) の sub-stage で段階展開。Budget 規模は orbital launch を含むと S1-S4 累計と同等の追加 capex を要求 — religious-corp Treasury sensitivity の極限値。" :authoritative-for ["kuni-umi S5 scope (4 extended sovereignty domains)" "Stewardship-only operational invariant in extended domains" "S5a/S5b/S5c/S5d sub-stage sequencing" "4 new robot classes (aquatic / underwater / aerial / orbital) introduction" "International law compliance pattern (UNCLOS / Chicago Conv. / OST / ITU)" "Witness invariant adaptation for remote domains" "kuni-umi roadmap closure (S5 PASS = roadmap complete)"] :depends-on ["adr-2605201400-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-planetary-infra-fleet" "adr-2605201500-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-s1-solo-survey" "adr-2605201600-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-s2-community-microgrid" "adr-2605201700-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-s3-multi-utility" "adr-2605201800-etzhayyim-kuni-umi-s4-multi-site-fleet" "adr-2605192100-etzhayyim-mission-charter" "adr-2605192230-etzhayyim-three-tier-enforcement-implementation" "adr-2605192245-etzhayyim-global-land-sovereignty" "adr-2605192315-etzhayyim-transparent-force-rd" "ad